Subject: [mbb-compat] Mirror format_args_nl shim into the boot crate

Macro names in macro_rules bodies are not hygienic: base's logging macros
(error!/warn!/log_err!/...) expand `format_args_nl!` in the textual scope of
the *expanding* crate, so the boot crate needs its own copy of the 0011 shim
(rustc no longer provides the internal builtin).

diff --git a/native/src/boot/lib.rs b/native/src/boot/lib.rs
index 2adf691..953fe2c 100644
--- a/native/src/boot/lib.rs
+++ b/native/src/boot/lib.rs
@@ -2,6 +2,13 @@
 #![feature(btree_extract_if)]
 #![feature(iter_intersperse)]
 
+// Compat (0012): mirror of the 0011 base-crate shim; see 0011 for rationale.
+macro_rules! format_args_nl {
+    ($($arg:tt)*) => {
+        format_args!("{}\n", format_args!($($arg)*))
+    };
+}
+
 pub use base;
 use cpio::cpio_commands;
 use dtb::dtb_commands;
